### The Map Room's page (je_te_map_room, common/journal_entries/te_journal_maps.txt; journal_map_modes.md).
###
###   widget_je_te_map_room   custom_widget_container_1 (above the description)
###     The picks (te_jmap_pick_row, gui/te_map_widgets.gui): one button per map, the current one pressed.
###
### The Map Room is contextless and nobody is involved in it, so its own scripted buttons would be locked; these are
### GUI buttons calling scripted GUIs with the player as root. Whether a widget draws on such a page is play-test
### check 1 (vanilla's je_great_game_control, also contextless, carries one); the debug strip repeats the row.

flowcontainer = {
	name = "widget_je_te_map_room"
	visible = "[JournalEntry.IsActive]"
	direction = vertical
	parentanchor = hcenter
	ignoreinvisible = yes
	spacing = 4
	margin_top = 6
	margin_bottom = 6

	textbox = {
		parentanchor = hcenter
		autoresize = yes
		multiline = yes
		max_width = 500
		align = center|nobaseline
		text = "te_jmap_room_pick_heading"
	}

	te_jmap_pick_row = {}
}
